# Local dev only. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) when running `pnpm dev`.
# Points the frontend at a locally-running Worker (`wrangler dev` in ../worker).
# In production the app falls back to the deployed Worker URL baked into
# src/pages/Approve/parse.ts, so this file is not needed for the build.
VITE_PARSE_URL=http://localhost:8787/parse
